{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】藝趣嘉年華在銅鑼灣舉行，約500人參與巨型木偶巡遊。</p>\n<p>沿途由裝扮成童話角色的舞蹈員以及學生開路，巡遊隊伍在維多利亞公園出發，途經記利佐治街及崇光百貨至東角道折返。</p>\n<p>嘉年華以童話故事為主題，設計出10座高達4米的巨型木偶公仔，不少小朋友駐足觀賞。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.335492+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:21:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.136294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.136294+00:00","content_hash":"10a3aec3e9f594ca79a94b609fa308dcff0daff45072bb10dd3c1ae2b3f18ea9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}